        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gemini Rush is a<strong> LAN racing game</strong> where each player controls a <strong>single-wheel vehicle</strong> on a circuit made up of <strong>two constantly parallel roads</strong>. The player has the <strong>ability to switch between the two</strong> using a skill. The vehicle is<strong> highly amenable and very fast</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Race</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>race is composed of 3 biomes</strong> (neutral, cave and fog) making the entourage beautiful and memorable ! The players drive on these roads in order to stay in first place. However all the <strong>players leave a trace behind them on the ground, a speed trail,</strong> that remains for 6s on which the other players can follow in order to gain a speed boost as long as they stay on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>many obstacles </strong>on both roads that the players need to avoid. If they hit them, they crash and respawn instantly where they were a few seconds earlier. The obstacles are different depending on which road is chosen, and it is important to<strong> learn your favorite path </strong>to save as much time as possible and go as fast as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G</strong>uilhem <strong>MAZOYER</strong> - Technical Game Designer, Producer &amp; UI/UX Designer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>J</strong>olan <strong>PRAT</strong> - Game Designer, Producer &amp; Level Designer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S</strong>oline <strong>MAILLARD</strong> - Gamer Designer &amp; UI/UX Designer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>M</strong>argaux <strong>SINET</strong> - 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B</strong>aptiste <strong>GARNIER </strong>- 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I</strong>ris <strong>DUBOIS VERGIAT</strong> - Technical Game Designer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X</strong>avier <strong>NICOLLE</strong> - Developer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C</strong>amille <strong>TOURNEMOLLE</strong> - Sound Designer</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gemini Rush is a<strong> LAN racing game</strong> where each player controls a <strong>single-wheel vehicle</strong> on a circuit made up of <strong>two constantly parallel roads</strong>. The player has the <strong>ability to switch between the two</strong> using a skill. The vehicle is<strong> highly amenable and very fast</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Race</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>race is composed of 3 biomes</strong> (neutral, cave and fog) making the entourage beautiful and memorable ! The players drive on these roads in order to stay in first place. However all the <strong>players leave a trace behind them on the ground, a speed trail,</strong> that remains for 6s on which the other players can follow in order to gain a speed boost as long as they stay on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>many obstacles </strong>on both roads that the players need to avoid. If they hit them, they crash and respawn instantly where they were a few seconds earlier. The obstacles are different depending on which road is chosen, and it is important to<strong> learn your favorite path </strong>to save as much time as possible and go as fast as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G</strong>uilhem <strong>MAZOYER</strong> - Technical Game Designer, Producer &amp; UI/UX Designer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>J</strong>olan <strong>PRAT</strong> - Game Designer, Producer &amp; Level Designer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S</strong>oline <strong>MAILLARD</strong> - Gamer Designer &amp; UI/UX Designer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>M</strong>argaux <strong>SINET</strong> - 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B</strong>aptiste <strong>GARNIER </strong>- 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I</strong>ris <strong>DUBOIS VERGIAT</strong> - Technical Game Designer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X</strong>avier <strong>NICOLLE</strong> - Developer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C</strong>amille <strong>TOURNEMOLLE</strong> - Sound Designer</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Gemini Rush is a LAN racing game where each player controls a single-wheel vehicle on a circuit made up of two constantly parallel roads. The player has the ability to switch between the two using a skill. The vehicle is highly amenable and very fast.",
